#: tabs/appearance.c:698
msgid ""
"kiwm e xispanel leem primeiro seu proprio tema (kiwm.conf/xispanel.conf); "
"qualquer\n"
"arquivo que faltar la (ou a ausencia de um tema proprio) cai neste tema "
"central antes\n"
"de usar a aparencia padrao embutida. xisserve nao usa isso -- so recebe "
"cores via\n"
"argumentos de quem o chama. Procurado em /usr/share/kidesktop/themes,\n"
"~/.local/share/kidesktop/themes e na pasta themes/ do codigo-fonte."
msgstr ""
"kiwm and xispanel read their own theme first (kiwm.conf/xispanel.conf); any\n"
"file missing there (or no theme of their own) falls back to this central "
"theme before\n"
"the built-in default look. xisserve doesn't use it -- it only gets colors "
"through\n"
"its caller's arguments. Looked up in /usr/share/kidesktop/themes,\n"
"~/.local/share/kidesktop/themes and the source tree's themes/ folder."

