#: tabs/appearance.c:769
msgid "Exportar temas/cores/icones/cursor para outros desktops (GTK/Qt)"
msgstr "Export themes/colors/icons/cursor to other desktops (GTK/Qt)"

#: tabs/appearance.c:772
msgid ""
"Quando desligado (padrao), essa aparencia so vale para a sessao KiDesktop.\n"
"Quando ligado, kiconfd tambem escreve em ~/.gtkrc-2.0, ~/.config/gtk-3.0 e "
"gtk-4.0/settings.ini e ~/.config/qt5ct/qt6ct -- os mesmos arquivos que "
"outros desktops (ex.: KDE Plasma) usam, entao apps GTK/Qt tambem mudam de "
"visual la."
msgstr ""
"When off (the default), this look only applies to the KiDesktop session.\n"
"When on, kiconfd also writes ~/.gtkrc-2.0, ~/.config/gtk-3.0 and gtk-4.0/"
"settings.ini and ~/.config/qt5ct/qt6ct -- the same files other desktops (e."
"g. KDE Plasma) use, so GTK/Qt apps change their look there too."

